      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jefferson%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jefferson eventually adopted its current name after the establishment of the Jefferson Institute in the area.",
